From: Jonas Faber <72028327+Jonohas@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:20:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 07/17] SystemUI: add the Duo fold animation blur overlay

On unfold the inner screen turns on blurred and clears with hinge
progress while Shell stretches tasks; on fold the inner screen blurs as
it closes and the cover screen clears from a blur over 350 ms. Every
exit removes the overlay, and a refused blur leaves the stretch.
